  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed in engineering, aviation, fitness, and medical contexts. {加圧|かあつ}トレーニング (pressure training) is a popular fitness method in Japan that restricts blood flow during exercise.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {加圧|かあつ}する (to pressurize)\n- {加圧|かあつ}トレーニング (pressure/blood-flow restriction training)\n- {加圧|かあつ}{装置|そうち} (pressurization device)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {減圧|げんあつ}: depressurization, reducing pressure",
